# `main` runs `review`, which keeps its report on the shelf `open_shelf` sets up, then sets the drafts up and reads the
# report from them, where it never kept one. A set-up counts for what runs after it (composition is call order, #359):
# the drafts are set up after the report is kept, so the write under `keep_report` writes `out/report.txt` alone, and
# nothing the route runs writes `drafts/report.txt`. A set-up counts for a method only where the value the method runs
# on may be one it built (#368): both set-ups ran before the read, but `report` runs on `drafts`, which `open_drafts`
# made, so the read under it reads `drafts/report.txt` alone, never what the write left in `out/report.txt`. The route
# takes `drafts/report.txt` from beyond it: it stands in the domain, and the closed `review` reads it. `out/report.txt` is
# only written.

route shelf.cli.main
step main/review
step main/review/open_shelf
step main/review/open_shelf/Shelf()
step main/review/Shelf.keep_report
step main/review/Shelf.keep_report/write
step main/review/open_drafts
step main/review/open_drafts/Shelf()
step main/review/Shelf.report
step main/review/Shelf.report/read

line entry > main call
line main/review/open_shelf/Shelf() > Shelf@main/review/open_shelf/Shelf() value
line Shelf@main/review/open_shelf/Shelf() > main/review/open_shelf value              # the shelf built goes back
line main/review/open_shelf > Shelf·shelf@main/review/open_shelf value
line Shelf·shelf@main/review/open_shelf > main/review/Shelf.keep_report/write value    # `write(self.root / "report.txt", text)`
line main/review/Shelf.keep_report/write > File(out/report.txt) own
line main/review/open_drafts/Shelf() > Shelf@main/review/open_drafts/Shelf() value
line Shelf@main/review/open_drafts/Shelf() > main/review/open_drafts value
line main/review/open_drafts > Shelf·drafts@main/review/open_drafts value
line Shelf·drafts@main/review/open_drafts > main/review/Shelf.report/read value        # `read(self.root / "report.txt")` on the drafts
line File(drafts/report.txt) > main/review/Shelf.report/read own
line main/review/Shelf.report/read > main/review/Shelf.report back                     # the text read goes back
line main/review/Shelf.report > main/review back
line main/review > main back
line main > Screen own                                                                  # `print(review())`

home Shelf@main/review/open_shelf/Shelf() main/review/open_shelf
home Shelf·shelf@main/review/open_shelf main/review
home Shelf@main/review/open_drafts/Shelf() main/review/open_drafts
home Shelf·drafts@main/review/open_drafts main/review

side entry left
side File(drafts/report.txt) left
side File(out/report.txt) right
side Screen right
